{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02F770","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"听说美国已经拿到了尼加拉瓜运河的建设权。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"美国根本没打算在尼加拉瓜建运河。因为他们已经在巴拿马开凿运河了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"尼加拉瓜一旦建成运河，巴拿马运河的垄断就会被打破。仅仅为了这一点，美国就一直横加干涉尼加拉瓜。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":141,"review_flag":"AUX_SECOND_SENTENCE_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"也就是说，他们拿到建设权，就是为了不让运河建起来。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_CORRECTED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"而向这样的美国举起反旗的，就是桑地诺将军。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":"AUX_YANQUIS_PARAPHRASE_REPLACED_BY_JPN"}]}